WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.760
Enrollments: students and guardians, enrollments, fees, attendance, progress and certificates.

2
00:00:09.311 --> 00:00:14.950
DM enrollments arrive automatically; for a walk-in, click "New enrollment".

3
00:00:15.496 --> 00:00:22.800
Open an enrollment; "Request payment" sends a payment link and "Paid at desk" records a desk payment.

4
00:00:23.354 --> 00:00:31.390
To change class, "Transfer"; write progress notes under "Progress & certificates" and click "Issue certificate".

5
00:00:31.943 --> 00:00:35.570
For a minor, click "Request guardian consent".

6
00:00:36.117 --> 00:00:41.260
Enter the guardian's number correctly; absence and fee messages go to them.
